  "prefLabel": "Gen 200 PROCEDURAL RULES",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Gen 200 PROCEDURAL RULES\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #13554, effective 4-11-23, repealed Part Gen 201 through Part Gen 218 containing all of the former rules in Chapter Gen 200 and adopted a new rule Part Gen 201 titled “Rules of the Practice and Procedure” containing Gen 201.01 titled “Applicability of Ahp 200” and Gen 201.02 titled “Waiver of Substantive Rules.”\n\nDocument #13554 replaced all prior filings for the former Chapter Gen 200. The prior filings affecting the former rules in Chapter Gen 200 included only Document #10651, effective 8-6-14.\n\nAs practice and procedure rules, the rules in Chapter Gen 200 in Document #13554 will not expire except pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen200.html"
